anks to everyone who played the demo, left a review or made a video. We read everything you write, for real. What's on the server? • Feedback & suggestions: What did you love, what didn't click, what's missing? Tell us directly. • Bug reports: Something broke? Let us know and we'll jump on it. • Dev updates: New features, patches and behi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T16:23:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042298","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:35:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136710-1847286114032921","game_id":"steam-5136710","kind":"announcement","title":"200 Wishlists! Thank you, smashers!","summary":"Hey smashers! Goblin Smasher just passed 200 wishlists and honestly we're still kind of in shock. 200 people saw a little game about smashing goblins and went \"yep, I want that.\" That means a lot to us. Thank you to everyone who wishlisted, played the demo, left feedback or just said something nice. You got us here. The free demo is still live and we're part of Steam Next Fest until October 26. If you haven't tried it yet, now's the perfect time. And if you already did, we'd love to hear what yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:32:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032921","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:31:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136710-1847286114030443","game_id":"steam-5136710","kind":"announcement","title":"Your language, polished: translation fixes in all 30 languages","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46308308/2bcc64d9fa4c823be1364f9679a270be6678bdfc.gif Goblin Smasher speaks 30 languages, and this week we went through every one of them, card by card. Here is what changed in the free demo. What we fixed Talent cards: descriptions, the NEW badge and rarity names are translated, and long names and descriptions fit the card. War Tree: tooltips no longer mix English with your language. Switching language: open screens and settings refresh at once, no restart needed. Fixed garbl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:53:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030443","verified_at":"2026-10-22T02:22:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136710-1846651706687954","game_id":"steam-5136710","kind":"announcement","title":"Goblin Smasher now speaks 30 languages!","summary":"30 languages Smash goblins in your own language. Goblin Smasher now has a full interface in 30 languages, written in everyday talk, not stiff dictionary text. 🇬🇧 English 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇫🇷 Français 🇪🇸 Español 🇲🇽 Español (Latinoamérica) 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇵🇹 Português 🇧🇷 Português (Brasil) 🇷🇺 Русский 🇺🇦 Українська 🇵🇱 Polski 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇭🇺 Magyar 🇷🇴 Română 🇧🇬 Български 🇬🇷 Ελληνικά 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇩🇰 Dansk 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇳🇴 Norsk 🇫🇮 Suomi 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T20:32:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136710-1846651706685119","game_id":"steam-5136710","kind":"announcement","title":"A new look, and the demo now runs on Mac","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46308308/ac038d55e65bd514d98717cbcbd3f34657775ff7.png The demo now runs on Mac The free Goblin Smasher demo now runs natively on macOS, on Apple Silicon and Intel Macs. The full game is coming to Mac too. A new look Goblin Smasher has new key art and a new logo. You can see them on the store page and in your library. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46308308/8be3f9c39b290b6826a973a7d50b73c267c6bdc6.png What is new in the demo Combos that build up. Your combo now climbs through tiers: SMASHI","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T17:12:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5136710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5136710":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5136710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z"},"5368040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:18Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5136710","app_id":5136710,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2176bf17145520fdae896ee44618a76a29099bcdd2d4dfd61abab2e38a38a973","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"고블린 위로 마우스를 올리면 망치가 알아서 짓뭉갭니다. 고요한 초원의 몇 마리로 시작해 한 화면 가득한 수천 마리로 끝납니다. 8개의 고블린 땅을 해방하고, 랜드마크를 세우고, 전설의 망치 10자루를 휘둘러 고블린 왕을 무너뜨리세요. 손맛 가득한 도트 그래픽 인크리멘탈 게임.","publishers":[{"name":"MONADRA"}],"developers":[{"name":"MONADRA"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"tr